  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fragmentum-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5b213b?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fragmentum-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5b213b?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fragmentum-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo Forge-5b213b?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=231C25&color=5b2121\"></a>\n</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Fragmentum 是一款輕量級核心庫，供 Obscuria Collection 系列的其他模組使用。它本身並不提供額外內容，僅在其他模組需要時才需安裝。由於它提供了共用工具與多載入器架構，能讓其他模組保持精簡、易於維護，且無需編寫依賴特定載入器的程式碼。</h2>",
